{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Viking age</strong> \u2013 uncertain times for Europeans when the Norsemen started a large-scale conquest campaign throughout Europe to broaden their territories. Become one of the leaders of one such group and, after pillaging a small village, you and your Viking brothers decide to settle down and <strong>build your own settlement</strong> on top of these ashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SHAPE YOUR SETTLEMENT</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401370/extras/1.png?t=1747729983\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Viking City Builder is a <strong>colony building game</strong>. Make a new place to live for your Viking brothers and sisters, build homes, longhouses, boating houses, ritual houses and many more constructions from the era. <strong>Manage your people\u2019s daily lives</strong> \u2013 assign them roles, manage resources, and expand your community. Let your villagers hunt, gather, and work the land.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SURVIVE, PILLAGE AND THRIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401370/extras/2.png?t=1747729983\" /></div><br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The North is harsh and full of threats \u2013 from roaming bandits to wild animals and harsh conditions. <strong>Protect your settlement when danger strikes</strong>. Stockpile supplies, equip your fierce warriors and send them to pillage, prey on the weak and steal their goods. Gather fuel and food supplies, because the harsh winters in the North will be a real challenge. Face a series of unpredictable events that will test your leadership and planning skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WITNESS THE NORTH IN STUNNING DETAIL</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401370/extras/3.png?t=1747729983\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of a Viking world brought to life through <strong>stunning visuals</strong>, from snow-covered forests to windswept fjords. Watch your village evolve from a pile of ruins into a thriving Norse stronghold, brick by brick, boat by boat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TRADE BY SEA, RULE BY LAND</strong><br>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401370/extras/4.png?t=1747729983\" /></div><strong>Establish trade routes across the sea</strong> and exchange goods with other settlements to gain resources and wealth. Build docks to support your maritime economy, and <strong>strengthen your position in the region</strong> not just through force, but commerce.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1401370?t=1747729983","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401370/daa910ca6476b376348537dd309dc6a1aba2d6cb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747729983","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401370/a03e069d3c4c4d76a8a22ad112f71cf3e8bec819/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747729983","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401370/a03e069d3c4c4d76a8a22ad112f71cf3e8bec819/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747729983","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Viking age</strong> \u2013 uncertain times for Europeans when the Norsemen started a large-scale conquest campaign throughout Europe to broaden their territories. Become one of the leaders of one such group and, after pillaging a small village, you and your Viking brothers decide to settle down and <strong>build your own settlement</strong> on top of these ashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SHAPE YOUR SETTLEMENT</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401370/extras/1.png?t=1747729983\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Viking City Builder is a <strong>colony building game</strong>. Make a new place to live for your Viking brothers and sisters, build homes, longhouses, boating houses, ritual houses and many more constructions from the era. <strong>Manage your people\u2019s daily lives</strong> \u2013 assign them roles, manage resources, and expand your community. Let your villagers hunt, gather, and work the land.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SURVIVE, PILLAGE AND THRIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401370/extras/2.png?t=1747729983\" /></div><br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The North is harsh and full of threats \u2013 from roaming bandits to wild animals and harsh conditions. <strong>Protect your settlement when danger strikes</strong>. Stockpile supplies, equip your fierce warriors and send them to pillage, prey on the weak and steal their goods. Gather fuel and food supplies, because the harsh winters in the North will be a real challenge. Face a series of unpredictable events that will test your leadership and planning skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WITNESS THE NORTH IN STUNNING DETAIL</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401370/extras/3.png?t=1747729983\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of a Viking world brought to life through <strong>stunning visuals</strong>, from snow-covered forests to windswept fjords. Watch your village evolve from a pile of ruins into a thriving Norse stronghold, brick by brick, boat by boat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TRADE BY SEA, RULE BY LAND</strong><br>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401370/extras/4.png?t=1747729983\" /></div><strong>Establish trade routes across the sea</strong> and exchange goods with other settlements to gain resources and wealth. Build docks to support your maritime economy, and <strong>strengthen your position in the region</strong> not just through force, but commerce.</p>","developers":["Titan GameZ"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1401370/d3a6d98cd76277de6f6be06b0f8c5f3b1d20812e/header.jpg?t=1747729983","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Viking City Builder","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6500<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1060</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce RTX 2060</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Titan GameZ"]